# expect-error: parameter
# Conformance: a closure-returning proc's body-tail literal must match the
# declared [Proc …] return arity (TYPED_CLOSURES_DESIGN.md §2.3). Here the
# return declares one param but the tail literal has two.
proc bad {i64 n} [Proc [i64] i64] { proc {x y} {+ $x $y} }
proc main {} { print [[bad 1] 2] }
main
